# Our Team 

The Developer Experience team is made up of two squads, the Blueprint Team and the Engineering Platform Team. 

## Blueprint Team

Our mission is to make engineering simpler and more efficient, so teams can focus on delivering high-quality solutions rather than navigating complexity. Through continuous improvement, strong partnerships and a deep understanding of developer needs, we are building Blueprint as a trusted engineering experience that brings together the tools, guidance and services teams need to discover, adopt, manage and govern their engineering projects.

## Engineering Platform Team

The Engineering Platform team will deliver the foundational tools, services, and standards that empower engineers to build, ship, and operate software with greater speed, reliability, and confidence. We are here to reduce the barrier to entry for new services by delivering automated 'Golden Paths'. 

